{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415665","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415665","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041566501:0":{"text":"ワーオ！こんなとこで、ファッションセンスバツグンな人に会えるなんて！","source_cn":"哇哦，真难得，在这里能碰上懂时尚的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x019B6F424FE0B14D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566502:0":{"text":"お前もなかなか悪くねえな！俺様と服の好みが合う奴なんて滅多にいねえぞ！","source_cn":"你也不错啊，难得能见到打扮品味一致的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A90FC00105DF7C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566503:0":{"text":"お前、どこのもんだ？荒涼の砂漠にくることがあったら、リース様の名前を出しな！","source_cn":"你混哪边的？你要是到荒角沙漠这边，就报我诡草的大名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF949B80C6135DAD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566504:0":{"text":"アタシは、色んなとこをブラブラしてるよぉ。お腹が空いたらお金を稼いで、空いてないときは遊ぶの！","source_cn":"我？我哪里都逛逛，饿了就挣点钱，不饿就玩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA2B3B7DA8CD62B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566505:0":{"text":"でも、砂漠かあ。日差しがキツそうだし、砂だらけだし……それに、あっちには面倒くさいヤツがいるって、バクが言ってたのよねぇ。","source_cn":"沙漠啊，太晒了吧，又到处都是沙子，而且阿爆说那边有个烦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8099FB0351A6E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566506:0":{"text":"心配すんな、俺様がいれば、誰に絡まれたってへっちゃらさ！","source_cn":"你放心，在沙漠有我在，不管什么人找麻烦都不用怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50479DE9B7C6296C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566507:0":{"text":"そんときは、アサルターに乗せてやるよ！砂漠いち速い鳥なんだぜ！","source_cn":"到时候我带你坐坐炽翼冲锋者，他可是全沙漠速度第一！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D37E75AC78678E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566508:0":{"text":"へえ！この子がアサルター？乗り物の名前もカッコイイじゃん！","source_cn":"哦！这就是炽翼冲锋者吗？你给坐骑起的名字也很帅啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EBD48925D9E2DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566509:0":{"text":"こいつはただの乗り物じゃねえよ。俺様の兄弟であり、仲間であり、ダチでもあるのさ！","source_cn":"不止是坐骑，还是我的哥们儿，伙伴，朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39F5EA0420141DD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566510:0":{"text":"わっかるぅ！アタシにもそういうダチがいるよ！さっき言ってたバクがそうなの！","source_cn":"我明白我明白，我也有这样的好朋友！就是我刚刚说的阿爆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCF0DFA818DA9C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566511:0":{"text":"へえ、センスがいい上に、情にも厚いなんて、今どき珍しいじゃねえの！","source_cn":"你不仅懂时尚，还懂义气！如今这样的人越来越少见了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F720D127349F79D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566512:0":{"text":"古くさい連中ときたら、人のファッションにケチばかり付けてよ、あいつらは流行ってもんを分かってねえんだ！","source_cn":"那帮烦人的老家伙一天到晚说什么奇装异服的，根本不懂时尚嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83430BBFA3CB7D70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041566513:0":{"text":"そうそう！いつか時代遅れのジジババどもを黙らせてやりましょ！","source_cn":"没错！总有一天，得让那帮过时的老家伙们闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2E22765CC08D139","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库露露":{"text":"クルル","source":"库露露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:诡草":{"text":"リース","source":"诡草","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}